{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "b078009c0330642fa57223eaae30a8efe91c1e1886db98eaa16e15701ad0b322", "ja": "情熱のためらい", "zh": "热情的踌躇", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "b832b40e17bea8526cd8b56783bbb6b369773517222f003af8f9fcba8a9dbc7e", "ja": "ダンスレッスンに励むメンバー達。やがて届\nいた曲の歌詞を目にし、そのド直球な愛の表\n現に赤面してしまう。気を取り直し、まずは\nテーマへの理解を深めるため、フラメンコの\n鑑賞に行く事に。", "zh": "努力进行舞蹈练习的成员们。终于看到送来的歌曲歌词后，被那直截了当的爱情表达弄得满脸通红。重新振作起来，为了加深对主题的理解，决定去欣赏弗拉门戈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9d921d74cddb4029c4076dd7bbb2fa005624e1874f3e0f349172d05e2bcfcc93", "ja": "（フラメンコユニット『chicAAmor』始動！　今は\nダンスレッスンを先行してすすめてもらっている）", "zh": "（弗拉明戈组合“chicAAmor”启动！目前先让她们专心进行舞蹈练习）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_02_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "a61ef1f6285d967be940f33ee3426a43c337698ef21830b185712396510319f9", "ja": "これで、フィニッシュ！　……うーん。\n通しでダンス、踊れはしたけど……。", "zh": "这样就完成了！……嗯——\n虽然能把整段舞蹈跳下来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_02_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "88851ae7e0719ad7e661928abd8ae68eb16ef9aaef885f7bd10e37ce3c76e69f", "ja": "まだ、ステップが出来てるだけって感じだ。\n形だけで、ハートがないっていうか……。", "zh": "感觉还只是把舞步跳出来了而已。\n只是空有形式，缺少了心意，或者说是灵魂……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_02_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "bd78b09c4964c1838fe45423cfa3e9c507f181711f095059115ace1bacf0a864", "ja": "うん。技術っていうより、\n表現力の問題なのかな……？", "zh": "嗯。与其说是技术问题，不如说是表现力的问题吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_02_1004_050jul", "source_sha256": "26b6bc482ccfe2beae8c083acb7d4a056359111a4feb06f1584eb4d1839d706c", "ja": "ムズいな。ただでさえダンスは苦手だってのに……。\nあ、でも千鶴は結構キマってたよな？", "zh": "好难啊。本来我就不擅长跳舞……  \n啊，不过千鹤跳得还挺像样的吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_02_1005_038chz", "source_sha256": "150f9522e5da414ad1cb6ff2be0cf35b1e80a03b093251d97f31630d3ab8dd52", "ja": "一応ひと通りは……。\nまだまだ、それらしく、というだけですけれど。", "zh": "基本上算是都练过一遍了……\n不过还远远不够，只是勉强有点样子而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_02_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "dd8cbaf32290b8b4f8f3a367822acf67b93755db29b2df0ae22435ab5533468b", "ja": "でもポーズとか、すっごく様になってました！\nきっとポイントを押さえてる感じなんですね。", "zh": "不过，姿势什么的，已经非常像样了！\n一定是掌握了其中的要领吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_02_1007_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0d136f32a8f2416ab14ddef6e67337506d78d603464b58d116a02a09d6596cef", "ja": "千鶴ちゃんは、演劇公演の経験も豊富だから。\nそのあたりの経験が活きてるのかも♪", "zh": "因为千鹤也有着丰富的戏剧演出经验嘛。\n说不定正是那些经验派上用场了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_02_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "27e681f2b6b40ec81904957666e422753eda13d809b7c7ccbf83d6736230a986", "ja": "そういうフーカも、いい感じじゃないか？\nフラメンコの雰囲気バッチリって感じだったぜ？", "zh": "这样的风花，不也挺有感觉的吗？\n感觉弗拉明戈的氛围拿捏得恰到好处吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_02_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d984839a14d86b65866da2ee24e2cd791a2f460891c987cd4e5b0a42dd4312c5", "ja": "え、ホント？　うれしいなぁ……！\nありがとう、ジュリアちゃん♪", "zh": "诶，真的吗？好开心啊……！\n谢谢你，茱莉亚♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_02_1010_038chz", "source_sha256": "aa99e3fd459bf5dbd070258d956f147bc21280a25e3117cd240620f7c4f5cd77", "ja": "風花は、ひとつひとつの表情や仕草から魅力を感じます\nもの。それもきっと、仕事の成果ですわね。", "zh": "我能从风花一个个的表情和动作中感受到魅力。那也一定是工作成果吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_02_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "320075ea7e4be95c24cd832fd7971653415ea4ee0330fac6d8a78bcda85c3615", "ja": "やっぱり大人の魅力ですよね。風花さん、\n私が見ててもドキドキしちゃうくらいだもん……。", "zh": "果然还是成熟魅力最让人心动呢。风花小姐，我光是看着都紧张得心怦怦跳……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_02_1012_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9fa0ed1b28da1ba4cdce26a0ee9f0320f9ad997c726b58d6379e2c4b3baabd51", "ja": "そ、そんなこと……あれ？\nその、大人の魅力っていうのは、もしかして……？", "zh": "才、才不是那回事……咦？\n那个，你说的成熟魅力，该不会是指……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_02_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "cb9f986c5bb7b59510ba5ece5148dac234b33cecd73b786ad90694723713b1fd", "ja": "つまり、セクシーってことだけど？", "zh": "也就是说，很性感吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_02_1014_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e559038d326d065d7ac13baa41792e27edc75c2b3cff7ee4dde06456aefb9b3f", "ja": "やっぱり～！　うう、経験が活きてるのは嬉しいけど\n……やっぱりセクシーなお仕事、控えようかな……？", "zh": "果然是这样～！呜呜，经验派上用场虽然很高兴\n……但我果然还是尽量别接性感的通告了吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_02_1015_p", "source_sha256": "9a557fd7334c1dc146c54406efa205d4aa768302d41d19725f4094244a4e1067", "ja": "みんな、お疲れさま。\n今日はいい知らせを持ってきたぞ！", "zh": "大家，辛苦了。\n今天我带来了好消息哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_02_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "82b422117c34f927140e2dc784dda2ae3db88dc6945193fa5259e1e41dc38e7c", "ja": "おはようございます、{$P$}！\nいい知らせってなんですか？", "zh": "早上好，{$P$}！\n你说的好消息是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_02_1017_p", "source_sha256": "6c7c4412f4e29d37e3e6f3107fafb247b5d9eca8fad315499cc051554dc6fde4", "ja": "例の曲の、曲名と歌詞が決まったんだ。\nさっそくみんなで、イメージを共有して欲しい。", "zh": "那首歌的歌名和歌词已经定下来了。\n希望大家马上一起分享一下对它的印象。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_02_1018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d8a43f79f37998162cde3c5b25dd4f896887398d5c13c1407574441b63d1295e", "ja": "わあ、楽しみにしてたんです♪　えっと……\n気持ちを切り替えて、歌詞を読み込みますね！", "zh": "哇，我一直很期待呢♪　那个……\n我先调整好心情，把歌词好好读一遍！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_02_1020_027say", "source_sha256": "b104f618d27ea7e5e397fef050ea448b3056fc4483219d2fc3158282e3fa7481", "ja": "『深紅のパシオン』……！", "zh": "『深红的热情』……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_02_1021_050jul", "source_sha256": "b104f618d27ea7e5e397fef050ea448b3056fc4483219d2fc3158282e3fa7481", "ja": "『深紅のパシオン』……！", "zh": "『深红的热情』……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_02_1022_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b104f618d27ea7e5e397fef050ea448b3056fc4483219d2fc3158282e3fa7481", "ja": "『深紅のパシオン』……！", "zh": "『深红的热情』……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_02_1023_038chz", "source_sha256": "b104f618d27ea7e5e397fef050ea448b3056fc4483219d2fc3158282e3fa7481", "ja": "『深紅のパシオン』……！", "zh": "『深红的热情』……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_02_1024_038chz", "source_sha256": "3a01ea9991df957035318001e29ffd3e49a60bfc4972ef21f2ea8f11c29efe4e", "ja": "パシオンは、確かスペイン語で情熱ですわね……。\nその名に恥じぬ歌詞というか、なんというか……。", "zh": "“帕西翁”在西班牙语里，应该是热情的意思吧……\n该说是不辱其名的歌词，还是怎么说呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_02_1025_050jul", "source_sha256": "241c9c9f06dc9464ef37ff52311cf0fc93ff4ad480241d8c1d1543d3cc189579", "ja": "深紅の情熱、ド直球だな……恋とか愛の歌は\nたくさんあるけど、ここまでストレートなのか……！", "zh": "深红的热情，真是直球啊……关于恋爱和爱情的歌虽然很多，但居然能直白到这种程度吗……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_02_1026_027say", "source_sha256": "7d708e76020eab70a83862e0d5601940fc575eae33ad0aa5809f8f95855dbc03", "ja": "「情熱を語る口づけ、知りたい、貴方のそのすべてを」\n……ううっ、ひ、怯んじゃダメ、紗代子！", "zh": "“诉说热情的深吻，我想知晓你的一切”\n……呜呜，不、不能退缩啊，纱代子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_02_1027_041fuk", "source_sha256": "5a1c734b86bce163bf72b76d655096bf37e04a38dfb7fafb6454fed251a0732f", "ja": "「目眩がするほどの恋に溺れて、咲き乱れる」……。\nひ、控えるどころか、全身でセクシー……！", "zh": "“沉溺于令人目眩神迷的爱恋之中，恣意绽放”……。\n哪、哪里克制了，根本是全身都在散发性感魅力嘛……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_02_1028_050jul", "source_sha256": "6de962204601922df91b219b15a5cd1fce8f9cd1177ea681c49adb5337e46af0", "ja": "うぅ、まいったな……。\nなんか読んでるだけで、顔が熱くなってきた……。", "zh": "呜，真是伤脑筋啊……。\n光是读着，脸都开始发烫了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_02_1029_027say", "source_sha256": "09be496739f062206b3628a832b0084de4832a8ea98ab4b7604e580c04e5b22b", "ja": "フラメンコ、想像以上です。意外と私たちに\n向いてるかもって思ったけど、やっぱり……。", "zh": "弗拉门戈，比想象中还要……本来还觉得意外地挺适合我们的，可是果然还是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_02_1030_038chz", "source_sha256": "e6a2efe066d7cbec85024020cad619a0285ff42d7d81ddfeb9ffd153f691ad0e", "ja": "とんだ思い上がりだったかもしれませんわ……！", "zh": "也许是我太自以为是了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_02_1031_p", "source_sha256": "d25506ae745e4d6c57e8d66015e0b7e94baf12a5bd5a57967e59a05f59c34a16", "ja": "ま、まあまあ、落ち着いて、自分が掴みやすい所から、\nそれぞれ探っていってもらうとか……。", "zh": "那、那个，先冷静一下，可以从自己比较容易下手的地方，各自试着寻找……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_02_1032_050jul", "source_sha256": "4bee646bc21c19fdd0d2093d08a03cd97f03c85a51a28322b7a5113cb7c89f4c", "ja": "そうは言うけど。\nコイツはかなり、ハードル高いぜ？", "zh": "话是这么说没错。这个可相当难啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0204_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0204_story_02_1033_027say", "source_sha256": "160277fdbef1a2081d43afac2dc1b9e37e788e32782d4fffd67a7d05d04eb1ee", "ja": "フラメンコって、こんなにも情熱的なんだね。\nどうしても、はずかしくなっちゃいそう……。", "zh": "原来弗拉明戈是如此热情奔放的舞蹈啊。\n总觉得无论如何都会害羞起来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
